  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『倍轻松』颈部按摩仪</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机联动功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">倍轻松颈部按摩仪通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现对颈部按摩仪传统艾灸、艾灸碳、光疗、大师模式、放松模式、开肩模式等功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/fba83a68cd714bba92873e5227e21154.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-afba1f9b781141b7845bfd904771cf08-0-0257341e1ae778bd97591f960374e000797937caed6a1b12b7ddf1ec347260ad\" alt=\"车机大屏操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 421.00px;height: 689.50px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 颈部按摩仪车机联动</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.1 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">模式支持“开肩”、“混合”、“热灸”三种模式切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">手法替换支持“混合”、“拔筋”、“活力”、“硬核”；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压支持“低挡”、“中挡”、“高挡”三挡调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">热敷支持“关闭”、“低挡”、“高挡”三档调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">定时设置支持多种时间段；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/836cfbfd35fd41e5afc60d30ac1318f5.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-548ee8501aff41d8882d73c81253342f-0-efc74c879b28b27356d7954306f9c07b10e4ea99a94cf267f37e925785bb3ab3\" alt=\"设备-243-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑2-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ec5d5cf3bbad41c4ad57392c10dd89ac.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-cd0e7a5b27fd49749e8d9f8b1ff2b0a7-0-3e659ecc89dcab498ddc79875a3e43629a6672ab747556c29d31fd5a40aed0d3\" alt=\"设备-244-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 722.00px;height: 406.13px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/352287f2f98a4ac783a7a4e91f63e70b.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-7e51c62f670d4a57904013c544cb1979-0-134dde67f652f836cd95618e26ed269f97d8425f46dd64a0fd09af2d76eae7a1\" alt=\"设备-246-首页-颈部按摩仪(1)-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 718.00px;height: 403.84px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-4 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制3</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 车机语音功能</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音实现了车机大屏控制颈部按摩仪的全部功能。方便用户解放双手，畅享按摩。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端语音控制说明提供了操控该设备的语控提示词，如</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e047e01a88544d93bf9d5fb6d94efd9b.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-04f9f5ec377044369f7b101db558478b-0-e0428d736145f61a22adec29d014d473babf1ee8e7c938fe0137fe10ce63bd23\" alt=\"语控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 436.00px;height: 694.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-5 颈部按摩仪车机语控</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e227404f6b7645e69121ed1b83719bc9.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-d3af16fb505146d4ada9a8f9440421c0-0-5734548b391008bce8280adc665e91954e996335c20386327cf09489e6a48c7b\" alt=\"设备-100-首页-颈部按摩仪-语音控制说明-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6 颈部按摩仪车机语控说明</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 手机控制功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">颈部按摩仪离开车机的使用场景中，手机也可控制按摩仪的功能。从手机端比亚迪App的\"我的-&gt;智慧物联\"，添加颈部按摩仪，进入按摩仪的控制界面，该界面可显示并控制颈部按摩仪剩余电量、热敷模块状态、按压调节和剩余时间、当前模式等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7f389406c3bd46af92133d800e7f2203.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-40b09710519147648644f91f9bb325cb-0-6bb7575516bd727756516c01c2b6fecd931cff7f965f4f7d44149af740fdb962\" alt=\"手机操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 725.89px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9fde5bd04415436a8eb5abd34b844fa3.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-6397e57b7a364f558ea40bbdf858728e-0-3a77bbc0b5f77a9f2058775bb00a1dc6dae1db65078cb692c927e0805960fa96\" alt=\"缩小比例.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a6271d7d5d9046eda6daa0f1c2f84671.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-174734d0e73d4580980d86747182a02e-0-9810a4065607c580e11ea302340b2128e121e4757ca03b611e945071d967d99a\" alt=\"缩小2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 手机端操控颈部按摩仪</span></p>"
}
